# Code owners for this repository.
#
# Listed owners are requested for review automatically on every pull request
# that touches a matching path. This is a routing mechanism, not a permission:
# it decides who is *asked*, while the branch ruleset on `main` decides what is
# *required*.
#
# Ownership currently rests with a single maintainer. Once a `lsc-sde` team
# exists with the right membership, replace `@iwfarr` with that team handle
# (e.g. `@lsc-sde/ontology-maintainers`) so review does not stall if one person
# is unavailable. See MAINTAINERS.md.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
* @iwfarr

# The ontology itself. Changes here alter published definitions, so they
# warrant maintainer review even when the diff looks small.
/data/ @iwfarr

# Build, deployment and policy configuration. A mistake in `deploy.yml` or
# `vite.config.ts` can take the public site down without failing CI.
/.github/ @iwfarr
/vite.config.ts @iwfarr
/package.json @iwfarr
